    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/0",
    "raw": "Little is known of what have been dubbed 'Atropus' worlds. The reference to atrophy is apt, for the innate strangeness of these celestial bodies cause murmurs of fear in every known species inhabiting the galaxy. Many theorize these fleshy worlds are sapient. Preposterous, but people will always be superstitious. Still, one must give credit where it is due: These places are unsettling.",
    "value": "人们对所谓的“肉源”世界知之甚少。根据atrophy（肌肉萎缩）来命名它十分恰当，因为这些天体的固有奇异性引起了居住在星系中的所有已知物种的恐惧低语。许多人推测这些肉源世界是有智慧的。这很荒谬，但人们总是迷信于此。然而，我们必须承认：这些地方确实令人不安。"
  },
  {
    "op": "replace",
    "path": "/contentPages/1",
    "raw": "The stench can only be tolerated for so long. Eventually the rankness permeates even the most adequate protections. At that point it becomes almost impossible to keep a mask on. Involuntarily, you will eventually try to pry it off, despite knowing the air makes you crazy. The team has dubbed it 'the meat fever' and it is liable to be the death of us if care is not taken.",
    "value": "上面的气味没人能忍受太久。到最终，这股腐臭甚至渗透进最好的防护措施中。到了那个时候，人几乎不可能继续戴着口罩。不由自主地，你最终会试图把它扯掉，尽管知道空气会让你发疯。研究团队将其称之为“血肉狂热”，如果不慎重处理，这可能会致命。"
  }
